lem-cauchy.latex:
\begin{lemma}[{coupled Cauchy inequality}]\label{lem-cauchy}
For every symmetric $Z\in\mathbb S^m$ and $q\in\mathbb R^m$,
\begin{equation}\label{eq:10.10}
(\operatorname{tr}(ZE)+q^Tj)^2
\le\sigma\left[
