lem-inverse-trace.latex:
\begin{lemma}[{inverse-trace interpretation}]\label{lem-inverse-trace}
Suppose $0<\sigma<\sigma_*$. Set $\eta=d\tau/4$ and $x=d\sigma/4$. Then \eqref{eq:10.10}, for all $Z,q$, is equivalent to
\begin{equation}\label{eq:10.19}
R_+=E+\frac12I_m-\frac{jj^T}{\eta}\succ0,
\qquad \operatorname{tr}(R_+^{-1})\le2m.
\end{equation}

Similarly, \eqref{eq:10.15} is equivalent to
\begin{equation}\label{eq:10.20}
R_-=tI_m-E-\frac{jj^T}{x}\succ0,
\qquad \operatorname{tr}(R_-^{-1})\le\frac{m}{t-e_*}.
\end{equation}

\end{lemma}
